  "body": "**Link to problem area**: https://spec.matrix.org/v1.2/rooms/v9/#authorization-rules\r\n\r\n**Issue**\r\n\r\n> 4. If type is m.room.member:\r\n> \r\n>     1. If no state_key key or membership key in content, reject.\r\n>     2. If content has a join_authorised_via_users_server key:\r\n>         1. If the event is not validly **signed by the user ID denoted by the key**, reject.\r\n> \r\n> \r\n\r\nEmphasis mine. I think it should read \"signed by _the homeserver of_ the user ID denoted by the key\".",
